# mix-of-capabilities 04×23 — una lacuna reale genera la ricerca mirata.
# «what is a fire blanket?» riceveva la definizione del fuoco: il modificatore e'
# un topic noto e la testa no. Il topic che non nomina la testa del composto si
# ritira (asked_head_misses/2, grammar.p0) e la lacuna nomina il nome intero, cosi'
# la memoria profonda puo' essere consultata su quello. Rete spenta: deterministico.
[mock live]
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test the known modifier does not answer for the compound]
!timeout 30
> what is a fire blanket?
<~ fire blanket
<! hot, visible reaction zone
> what is an electron microscope?
<~ electron microscope
<! negatively charged particle

[test the whole known topic and the bare word still answer]
!timeout 30
> what is the carbon cycle?
<~ exchanges carbon
> what is water?
<~ hydrogen and oxygen

[test the head side is knowledge: without it the modifier answers again]
!timeout 30
!forget compound_head_side(en, last)
> what is a fire blanket?
<~ hot, visible reaction zone
!assert compound_head_side(en, last)
